h","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/43","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000090","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000091","type":"text","text":"‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Feeling Pumped gives the player unlimited adrenaline for 10s upon activation, which allows the player to deal massive damage in a short time, and is required for this style of farming."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000091"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000092","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000045","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/45","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000093","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000094","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000095","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000047","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/47","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000096","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000097","type":"text","text":"⬥ Shattered worlds has 3 main objectives, kill X amount of enemies, deal X amount of damage, or repair the portal. Completing an objective quickly rewards the player with skipping worlds in that bracket, up to 3 worlds skipped if the first world is completed in under 1 minute."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000097"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000098","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000049","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/49","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000099","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000100","type":"text","text":"‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• To farm anima efficiently, skipping worlds is the priority. However, due to RNG in the objectives, skipping 2 worlds is often more achievable."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000100"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000101","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000051","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/51","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000102","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000103","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000104","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000053","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/53","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000105","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000106","type":"text","text":"⬥ Ranged "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000107","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"range","class":"d-emoji","alt":"range","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/580168050121113623.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000108","type":"text","text":" offers the most efficient way to farm these worlds, via the usage of the Dark bow special attack "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000109","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"dbow","class":"d-emoji","alt":"dbow","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/643848618553507843.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000110","type":"text","text":" "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000111","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"eofspec","class":"d-emoji","alt":"eofspec","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1257438999794946099.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000112","type":"text","text":", stored in an Essence of Finality necklace "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000113","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"eof","class":"d-emoji","alt":"eof","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/787526151978614824.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000114","type":"text","text":" to allow it to be used with Mechanical chinchompas "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000115","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"mechchin","class":"d-emoji","alt":"mechchin","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/641669268722810881.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000116","type":"text","text":", allowing the player to often one-hit large groups of enemies. If Feeling Pumped has not activated yet, simply use basic abilities or thresholds like Snapshot "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000117","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"snap","class":"d-emoji","alt":"snap","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535534127131394088.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000118","type":"text","text":". An example video is shown below featuring various world skips."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000106","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000108","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000112","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000114","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000116","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000118"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000119","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000055","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/55","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000120","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000121","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000122","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000057","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/57","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000123","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000124","type":"element","tag":"em","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000125","type":"text","text":"Note: Melee can also be viable, having strong AoE potential with abilities such as ("},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000126","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"cleave","class":"d-emoji","alt":"cleave","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535532878616985610.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000127","type":"text","text":", "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000128","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"cane","class":"d-emoji","alt":"cane","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535532878969438210.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000129","type":"text","text":", "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000130","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"quake","class":"d-emoji","alt":"quake","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535532879506309150.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000131","type":"text","text":", "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000132","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"meteorstrike","class":"d-emoji","alt":"meteorstrike","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535532879359377439.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000133","type":"text","text":", "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000134","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"bd","class":"d-emoji","alt":"bd","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/535532854281764884.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000135","type":"text","text":"), however will be significantly slower than ranged."}]}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000125","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000127","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000129","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000131","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000133","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000135"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000136","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000059","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/59","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000137","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000138","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000139","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000061","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/61","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000140","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000141","type":"text","text":"⬥ As speed is the most important factor here, Acceleration potions "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000142","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"powerburstofacceleration","class":"d-emoji","alt":"powerburstofacceleration","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/756236265472524418.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000143","type":"text","text":" can be particularly helpful for clearing large distances, to get to more enemies or to rush to the portal after finishing an objective. If getting to the portal quicker will help with world skips, use it, otherwise save it for the next world where it may come in more useful, this is up to the player's discretion."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000141","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000143"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000144","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000063","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/63","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000145","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000146","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000147","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000065","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/65","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000148","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000149","type":"text","text":"⬥ The usage of Target Cycling is heavily recommended. This is due to auto-attacks stalling repeated Essence of Finality special attacks "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000150","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"eofspec","class":"d-emoji","alt":"eofspec","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1257438999794946099.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000151","type":"text","text":", preventing you from continuously speccing whilst Feeling Pumped is active. Targets can still be clicked if the player is careful not to auto-attack."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000149","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000151"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000152","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000067","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/67","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000153","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000154","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000155","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000069","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/69","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000156","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000157","type":"text","text":"⬥ Soulsplit "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000158","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"soulsplit","class":"d-emoji","alt":"soulsplit","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/615613924506599497.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000159","type":"text","text":" is used for all healing, as the massive damage dealt generates a lot of healing. Solid food is also recommended, as adrenaline is effectively infinite, alongside healing a large amount in one bite and therefore has no downside."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000157","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000159"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000160","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000071","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/71","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000161","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000162","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000163","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000073","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/73","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000164","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000165","type":"text","text":"⬥ The best modifiers to take after Feeling pumped are variable, but generally consistent. Electric, Explosive (if not using "},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000166","type":"element","tag":"img","attrs":{"title":"melee","class":"d-emoji","alt":"melee","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","width":"24","height":"24","src":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1096130867279171706.png?v=1"},"children":[]},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000167","type":"text","text":") and Charged. However, with an objective like kill X mobs, a negative modifier like Hydra can be positive."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000165","pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000167"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000168","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000075","type":"paragraph","editable":true,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/75","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000169","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000170","type":"text","text":"‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• In the case of no positive modifiers, options like Zombie Apocalypse, Zone of Suffering or Hungry are the least negative options and can be ignored."}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000170"],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000171","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000077","type":"paragraph","editable":false,"label":"p","sourcePath":"root/77","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000172","type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000173","type":"text","text":"​"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":[],"tail":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000174","type":"text","text":"\n"}},{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:b:000079","type":"heading","editable":true,"label":"h3","sourcePath":"root/79","node":{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000175","type":"element","tag":"h3","attrs":{"id":"ranged-preset"},"children":[{"id":"pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:000176","type":"text","text":"Ranged Preset"}]},"editableTextNodeIds":["pvme-guides--slayer--shattered-worlds:n:0